<title>UK: Sears says re-opens talks with Littlewoods.</title>
<headline>Sears says re-opens talks with Littlewoods.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail group Sears Plc said on Wednesday it had re-entered talks on the sale of its Freemans home shopping business with Littlewoods. Sears said it had ended talks with the N. Brown Group Plc because it could not agree satisfactory terms.</p>
</text>
